	tristate "MediaTek Power MT6337 Driver"
	default n
	---help---
	  This selects for MediaTek(R) PMIC MT6337 driver.
	  It's sub chip type and used mainly in audio controlling.
	  Set y to support this driver.
	  Set n and choose other chip.

